---
---
<section id="inicio" class="relative overflow-hidden pt-6 pb-16 md:py-24">
  <!-- Subtle watercolor atmosphere glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-5 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-emerald-light/50 blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-1/3 right-10 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-quartz-mist/70 blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-10 left-1/3 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-gold-wash/30 blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
    <!-- Left column: Storytelling & Action -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-7">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase border border-quartz/30 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm text-emerald shadow-sm">
        <span>🌙</span> <span id="hero-badge">Joyería & Orfebrería en el Valle de Elqui</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-semibold text-ink-deep leading-[1.12]" id="hero-title">
          Joyas hechas con <span class="italic text-emerald">pasión</span>, mística y <span class="text-terracotta italic">alma</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="font-script text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-terracotta">
          Donde la luz del Cerro Mamalluca se funde con el metal
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-ink-medium leading-relaxed max-w-2xl" id="hero-desc">
        Piezas únicas forjadas a mano por el orfebre <strong>Nicolás Cordero</strong> en Vicuña, Chile. Cada diseño nace del diálogo armónico entre plata, bronce y gemas naturales seleccionadas bajo los cielos más limpios del planeta.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2">
        <a href="/tienda" class="button-primary text-base">
          <span>✧</span> Explorar Catálogo
        </a>
        <a 
          href="https://wa.me/56931983075" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="button-ghost text-base" 
          id="hero-whatsapp-btn"
        >
          <span>💬</span> Contactar al Taller
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Artisan Stats -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#EBDDCB]">
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <p class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-emerald" id="about-years-hero">15+</p>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted">Años de Oficio</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-1 border-x border-[#EBDDCB] px-3">
          <p class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-terracotta" id="about-handmade-hero">100%</p>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted">Hecho a Mano</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <p class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-gold">Vicuña</p>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted">Valle de Elqui</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right column: Official Watercolor Brand Card & Artwork -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
      <!-- Watercolor artistic frame -->
      <div class="relative card p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 bg-white/85 shadow-watercolor border border-[#E8DFC8]">
        <!-- Official Logo Watercolor Illustration Banner -->
        <div class="relative aspect-[16/10] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-inner border border-[#E5D4C0] bg-[#FAF6F0] p-1 group">
          <img 
            src="/images/logo-watercolor.jpg" 
            alt="Elqui Joyas - Obra e Identidad de Acuarela Oficial" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-xl transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
            id="hero-featured-img"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/30 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none rounded-xl"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 flex items-center justify-between text-white drop-shadow">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest bg-emerald-dark/80 backdrop-blur-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/20">
              ✧ Identidad Oficial
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium italic opacity-95">Colección de Autor</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-ink-muted" id="hero-featured-sub">
                Edición Limitada
              </p>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold text-ink-deep" id="hero-featured-title">
                Luz del Mamalluca
              </h2>
            </div>
            <span class="badge !text-[11px]">
              Gemas & Metales
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-sm text-ink-medium leading-relaxed" id="hero-desc-feat" id="hero-featured-desc">
            Cristales en acuarela, cuarzo y minerales nobles ensamblados lentamente con técnicas ancestrales de orfebrería chilena.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-ink-muted border-t border-[#EBDDCB]">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald"></span> Certificado de autenticidad
          </span>
          <a href="/tienda" class="font-semibold text-emerald hover:text-terracotta transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
            Ver piezas →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
